WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
Kaze ni kami ga nabiku

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
My hair flows in the wind.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
Kokoro ni hirogaru aozora no deai

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
An encounter in the blue skies of our hearts...

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Tooku hanaretetemo

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Though we are apart,

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
Kanjiru koto wa itsumo kimi dakara

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
I'm always thinking about you,

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
Itsu no hi ka mune wo hatte

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
so let's promise to meet again

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
Au koto wo yakusoku shiyou

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
one day, with our heads held high.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
Zutto futari owari no nai

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
We'll be together, like a dream

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
Yume wo egaku you ni

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
with no end.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
Kimi ni

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
I want

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
Kono omoi itsu no hi ka tsutaetai

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
to tell you this someday.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
Sabishisa wo shiawase ni kaeru tame

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
I'm right here next to you

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
to turn your loneliness into joy.

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
Soba ni iru yo kokoro wa

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
I can feel your heart so close to mine.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
Konna ni chikaku ni kanjiru

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.080
Episode 2 - The Mask of Vivi

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:45.370
If you see a white camellia, you'll know...

00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:49.960
that we are meant to be together!

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:56.640
A red camellia means that all is lost!

00:01:57.580 --> 00:01:59.980
That is our sign...

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:03.870
the sign of our secret love!

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:07.960
Our love is no ordinary love.

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:15.820
Armand, you love me as though I have never been in the arms of another man...

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:22.100
but when I think that you may come to despise your own love for me,

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:29.960
and even persecute me because of my past with a view chasing me back into the situation...

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.750
I was in before I became yours; I can't help but be terrified.

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:38.230
How strange that these words carved themselves on my very heart...

00:02:38.230 --> 00:02:42.540
These words that first awakened my passion...

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:46.470
The sacred, noble pulse of the world in its entirety!

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:52.820
My heart is brimming with equal joy and sorrow... How strange this seems!

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:54.400
This feeling...

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:33.070
Miss...

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:34.610
Miss?

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:37.460
Excuse me, but today's performance has ended.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:39.630
Miss?

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:40.890
Huh?

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:43.660
The play has finished.

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:04.300
What is <i>wrong</i> with you, girl?

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:08.310
That's the third time today!

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:09.980
I'm really sorry.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:13.910
Maya's been acting weird lately.

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:16.320
Yeah, it's ever since she went to that play!

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:19.950
Since then, she's been talking to herself...

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:21.300
What's she been saying this time?

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:24.440
She said: "When shall we meet again?"

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:27.130
"When this flower has withered..."

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:34.410
What?! That far out?

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:36.940
Yeah, they want a bowl of ramen delivered.

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:39.110
They gave us 10,000 yen for the delivery.

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:41.360
What an odd customer!

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:45.650
Um... I'm from 10,000 Luck Restaurant...

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:47.050
I've brought your ramen.

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:50.500
The lady awaits you.

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:52.550
Please come in.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.160
Um... you're the...

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:08.110
We meet again.

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:16.330
Did you enjoy <i>La Traviata</i> ?

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.450
I loved it!

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:22.040
But how did you know I'd seen it?

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:26.440
Can you tell me what the play was about?

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:27.750
Come again?

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:38.420
So, no matter how many times you ask Chigusa Tsukikage, she won't agree to it?

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:43.600
And that's why you want my help.

00:05:46.390 --> 00:05:48.440
No, that's not what I'm saying.

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:52.810
With your influence, I doubt I can be of any help at all.

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:56.100
So you're saying...

00:05:56.100 --> 00:06:01.370
that you want me, a popular stage director, to shoulder the hateful repercussions.

00:06:01.370 --> 00:06:06.280
Gosh, the Hayami family sure are a sly bunch of dogs.

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:18.060
"Lady Marguerite, my Princess of Camellias. Are you trying to make a fool of me?"

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:24.870
"Sir Armand... it is only my affection that allows me tease to you.

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:33.910
How else would I have survived Parisian society?"

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:45.800
Madame, Masumi Hayami and Director Onodera are here to see you.

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:48.560
Can't you see we're busy? Tell them to leave us in peace.

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:55.240
We'll wait, no matter how long it takes.

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:11.060
Do you know this girl, Masumi?

00:07:11.850 --> 00:07:17.700
Yes, he does. He showed me to my seat at <i>La Traviata</i> .

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:19.860
So I did...

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:26.170
I didn't realize you were the type to show kindness to young girls.

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:29.520
Do I look so heartless?

00:07:29.730 --> 00:07:33.180
Of course you do. Just like your father.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:36.680
It must be hard... standing in as his representative.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:43.290
No, I didn't come here because he asked me to, but of my own accord.

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:48.030
Well then... I guess I'll be off!

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:49.580
Hold on a minute, Maya.

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.250
Won't you stay?

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:55.820
You see, I'm very fond of you.

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:58.620
Why don't you tell me what happened next?

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:01.550
It was such a good story. Please continue.

00:08:01.550 --> 00:08:02.670
But...

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:10.010
Mrs. Tsukikage... should we wait outside?

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:18.330
"When shall we meet again? When this flower has withered..."

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:23.530
"I know I can no longer make you happy."

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:32.670
"But I shall listen to you and obey your every whim for as long as I live!"

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:38.100
"Because I am forever yours!"

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:41.880
I know she's been out of the business for a long time,

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:46.750
but I have to wonder what Chigusa Tsukikage sees in that girl.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:49.850
It's obvious. The old woman's taken a shine to her.

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:53.410
And yet... I know you didn't ask for this, but...

00:08:53.410 --> 00:09:00.990
until we change her mind on the thing we talked about, we need to stay in Chigusa Tsukikage's good books.

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:04.240
Don't you agree, Masumi?

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:10.330
Oh no! I completely lost track of time!

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:12.020
Thanks for having me!

00:09:12.020 --> 00:09:13.220
Goodbye!

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:24.560
You just keep chewing up these young girls and spitting them out, don't you, Mrs. Tsukikage?!

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:28.500
Though I really can't see what you like about that one.

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:33.360
Bad delivery, bad stance, not to mention her pauses...

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:36.530
She doesn't have a single attribute that lends itself to acting!

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:41.580
You hit the nail on the head. She's a complete novice.

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:46.470
But I'm going to patiently train her.

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:53.500
Did you know, Mister Masumi, Mister Onodera... that girl...

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:57.030
has only seen <i>La Traviata</i> once!

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:06.320
And yet, she knows every single word of a three-and-a-half hour show!

00:10:06.320 --> 00:10:09.460
Right down to the characters' most insignificant gestures...

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:12.530
she's memorized the whole thing!

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:17.070
She's frightening.

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:25.220
That girl, Maya Kitajima, is absolutely frightening!

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:36.470
Are there any volunteers to participate in the school play?

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:37.060
Yes!

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:38.250
Yes!

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:43.010
I nominate Maya Kitajima!

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:44.030
What?

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:48.630
You're so good at imitating what you see on TV shows and movies.

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:52.720
I bet you'd be great in a play!

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:58.320
Seconded!

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:02.810
I don't mind you participating in the school play, but...

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:05.910
what about your deposits for the last two months?

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:09.000
I'm sorry... I guess I haven't paid them yet.

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:17.540
Hm... you in the school play, huh?

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:18.640
Yup!

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:21.200
I don't know what part I'll be playing yet, but...

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:25.510
<i>The Country's Top Bride</i> is such a fantastic play!

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:28.350
What's it about?

00:11:28.690 --> 00:11:33.220
It's about a prince who decides to search for a bride.

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:41.490
He has to find the most beautiful and noblest maiden in the land.

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:45.310
So the king and the prince puts every woman in the land through a series of tests.

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:47.620
The king puts on a display of mercy:

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:52.250
If this man condemned to death is taken by one of the maidens as her husband,

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:56.510
then she will redeem his sins and save his life.

00:11:57.240 --> 00:12:01.780
Even though Marianne has passed all the tests that have come before,

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:05.150
she sacrifices her chance to become queen and pledges herself to the condemned young man...

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:07.060
to save his life.

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:12.980
But the prisoner is actually the prince in disguise...

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:19.460
and because he now sees how noble and wonderful she is, he takes her as his bride!

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:22.020
Hm... sounds like a good story.

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:24.880
You'll come and watch, won't you, Mom?

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:28.610
Your mother doesn't have any nice clothes for such an event.

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:31.180
Just come as you are!

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:33.680
The store is closed that day too.

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:35.870
You could bring a packed lunch!

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:39.130
The kind you like with omelets and patties?

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:40.560
I'll bring one for you.

00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:47.050
The part of Vivi is the part of a clown.

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:49.760
To make people laugh, she's portrayed as an ugly jester.

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:53.080
You mean... I'm playing Vivi?

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:57.060
It's a difficult role, but I'm sure you can do it, Kitajima.

00:12:57.270 --> 00:13:00.490
Just so you know, everyone in the play is responsible for making their own costumes.

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:02.870
I know this will be difficult - especially with the girls' dresses - but...

00:13:02.870 --> 00:13:04.270
I'm sure you'll all do fine.

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:10.670
Sir... Vivi is meant to be poor, isn't she?

00:13:10.670 --> 00:13:14.130
Which is why you're allowed to use any old dress or cast-offs to play her.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:45.310
This is a difficult role... the hardest in the whole play.

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:48.470
Instead of focusing on a specific style,

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:51.450
this role requires attention to detail and the utmost subtlety.

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:53.800
Otherwise, it will be completely ignored.

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:54.830
Really?

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:57.030
Let me tell you something, Maya...

00:13:57.260 --> 00:14:02.320
When you stand on a stage, you are no longer yourself.

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:06.300
You stand up there wearing Vivi's mask.

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:09.940
You must stand there with her emotions, her personality,

00:14:09.940 --> 00:14:13.110
and her heart.

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:15.300
You're the one playing Vivi.

00:14:15.740 --> 00:14:20.340
Until you hold Vivi's heart in your hand, you cannot wear her mask!

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:23.320
Until I hold Vivi's heart in my hand...

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:27.060
Where others would fail, I know you can do this!

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:29.690
That's right - <i>you</i> alone can do this!

00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:31.320
I... can?

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:37.040
Yes. You must hide Maya Kitajima from view and become Vivi!

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:38.970
Do you understand?

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:43.260
Lady... Lady?!

00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:51.060
I knew this would happen.

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:54.880
I knew they'd give you a ridiculous role.

00:14:56.400 --> 00:14:59.240
The country's laughing stock...

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:04.400
And why not? It's not like anyone could expect a daughter of mine...

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:06.740
to play a serious role!

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:16.750
You hide yourself...

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:19.250
...hide my form...

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:21.210
and put on the mask...

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:25.230
Put on the mask...

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:33.160
"Thank you, Marianne."

00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:37.250
"You're so kind."

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:44.130
"You see, even though I embarrass easily, get depressed and am generally pitiful...

00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:52.180
Even though I'm ugly and not to be looked upon - it's not my fault..."

00:15:54.030 --> 00:15:56.850
Are you calling me stupid?

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:58.260
Kitajima!

00:15:58.260 --> 00:16:00.740
Thank you, Marianne!

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:03.030
You are so...

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:04.380
Kitajima!

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:13.940
Yotarou, that's why they call you stupid!

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:17.820
Why the hell can't I marry my sister Hana?

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:21.890
Look at Ma and Pa - they got married but they're my parents!

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:24.470
"They got married but they're my parents!"

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:26.130
Oh no, it's starting!

00:16:27.970 --> 00:16:30.890
"Yotarou, that's why they call..."

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:36.490
Mom?

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:38.180
Yes, dear?

00:16:38.590 --> 00:16:44.180
Vivi may be a ridiculous role, but I'll try my hardest.

00:16:44.180 --> 00:16:45.220
Is that right?

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:50.510
I know that I'm useless at everything and all I seem to achieve is to disappoint you,

00:16:50.510 --> 00:16:52.040
but I'm sure I'll do well at this.

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:56.090
I won't embarrass you.

00:16:56.540 --> 00:16:59.900
So, will you bring the packed lunches and come watch?

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:04.230
You... will come, won't you?

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:06.820
I told you I would! Stop asking!

00:17:10.870 --> 00:17:16.460
I'm sorry, Maya. I'm not trying to be spiteful or hurt you.

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:18.770
It's just so... depressing.

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:23.990
To have your only daughter turned into a laughingstock...

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:34.880
You see, even though I embarrass easily, get depressed and am generally pitiful...

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:41.590
Even though I'm ugly and not to be looked upon - it's not my fault!

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:44.190
Kitajima, you have to be more airy!

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:48.270
This is supposed to be a side-splittingly funny scene!

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:50.320
You're making it much too depressing!

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:51.760
Make it comical!

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:57.260
But sir... I mean, if I'm meant to be Vivi... when I'm her...

00:17:57.260 --> 00:17:59.910
I'm filled with such sadness.

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:05.160
Well, before you let sadness overcome you, go and read the script you've been given!

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:12.380
"So you're telling me you'd rather die than marry me?

00:18:12.380 --> 00:18:16.590
Ah, I knew what was in store for me and yet still, I persevered.

00:18:16.590 --> 00:18:19.570
I want to die!"

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:25.610
It doesn't feel right.

00:18:26.280 --> 00:18:30.450
When I become Vivi, I just can't be jolly.

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:36.700
Closed Today

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:36.660
I'm off!

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:39.710
The show is this afternoon.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:43.330
Don't forget the packed lunches, you hear?

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:14.110
She's still not here...

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:23.010
Why? But I'm going on a date!

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:27.250
That's why I'm asking you to drop these off at school on the way to meet him.

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:31.210
Miss Haru, why don't you just go yourself?

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:39.460
After a thirty-minute interval, we shall perform our school play entitled:

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:42.850
<i>The Country's Top Bride.</i>

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:47.260
Mom's still not here.

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:53.770
I'm sorry, Maya,

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:58.730
but your mother really doesn't want to see an audience laughing at her daughter.

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:16.590
Mom... why aren't you coming?

00:20:17.260 --> 00:20:19.770
I'm going to be great.

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:22.740
I'm going to be fantastic just so you can be proud of me.

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:25.540
You promised!

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:28.830
You promised you'd bring my favorite patty lunch!

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:30.970
You said you'd come watch me!

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:37.260
Now, we will commence our afternoon program.

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:57.960
You're the one playing Vivi.

00:20:58.180 --> 00:21:03.610
Until you have her heart in your hand, you cannot wear her mask!

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:07.230
Until I have Vivi's heart in my hand...

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:12.060
Where others would fail, I know you can do this!

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:14.760
That's right - <i>you</i> alone can do this.

00:21:21.610 --> 00:21:23.250
Maya Kitajima.

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:30.370
At this very moment, this young girl's heart was sizzling with her fierce passion for acting.

00:21:31.090 --> 00:21:37.750
Will she finally be able to wear Vivi's mask?

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:03.930
Gomennette iwaretara

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:03.930
When you say "I'm sorry,"

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:10.670
Anata wo semerarenai yo

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:10.670
I can't blame you.

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:21.510
Sonna watashi wo kitto shitterundeshou

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:21.510
I'm sure you know that's how I am.

00:22:21.510 --> 00:22:25.810
Nee zurui yo

00:22:21.510 --> 00:22:25.810
That's not fair.

00:22:26.510 --> 00:22:33.620
Yasashisa ni damasaretatte

00:22:26.510 --> 00:22:33.620
Even if I'm being fooled by kindness,

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:44.210
Anata nara isso iito shinjita

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:44.210
I believed that with you, it might be worth it.

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:53.690
Sayonara wa doushite itoshiindarou

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:53.690
Why are goodbyes so precious,

00:22:53.690 --> 00:22:58.250
Hanareteyuku noni

00:22:53.690 --> 00:22:58.250
even though they mean we're separating?

00:22:58.250 --> 00:23:07.640
Ushinatta ondo wo oboeteruyo

00:22:58.250 --> 00:23:07.640
I remember how it got colder.

00:23:07.640 --> 00:23:13.500
Yurushitai dakara anata

00:23:07.640 --> 00:23:13.500
I want to forgive you, so please don't go.

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:21.410
Ikanaide douka ikanaide

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:21.410
Whatever you do... just don't go.

00:23:22.530 --> 00:23:25.700
Maya, the girl who wore the mask of a clown.

00:23:25.700 --> 00:23:29.560
The role of a clown is to make people laugh.

00:23:30.030 --> 00:23:36.670
Oh, Maya, you're such an amazing girl. In the end, you weren't just a simple clown.

00:23:36.670 --> 00:23:42.470
An invisible bird has led you to the person who will one day become your nemesis.

00:23:42.830 --> 00:23:50.500
Once you have set Ayumi Himekawa's heart ablaze, all you can do is move forward.

00:23:46.660 --> 00:23:51.580
Episode 3 - The Bird That Flew Away
